; Regression (2026-10-25): the negative half of generic_receiver_call_arg.
; A call in a generic TEMPLATE whose arguments are all resolved is judged in
; the template, so a misspelt callee is reported even where nothing
; instantiates the routine; only a call that takes a value of a type
; parameter waits for its instantiations (Planner.template_dependent_call#).
; xfail: function not found: twise
function twice(n: i32) returns i32
    n * 2

function never_used[S](c: ref[S]) returns i32
    twise(21 as i32)

print "unreachable"
